{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1037","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Security"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Some programming website is establishing a secure communication protocol. For security reasons, they want to choose several more or less random strings."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially, they have a string $$$s$$$ consisting of lowercase English letters. Now they want to choose $$$q$$$ strings using the following steps, and you are to help them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" A string $$$x$$$ consisting of lowercase English letters and integers $$$l$$$ and $$$r$$$ ($$$1 \\leq l \\leq r \\leq |s|$$$) are chosen. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Consider all non-empty distinct substrings of the $$$s_l s_{l + 1} \\ldots s_r$$$, that is all distinct strings $$$s_i s_{i+1} \\ldots s_{j}$$$ where $$$l \\le i \\le j \\le r$$$. Among all of them choose all strings that are lexicographically greater than $$$x$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If there are no such strings, you should print $$$-1$$$. Otherwise print the lexicographically smallest among them. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"String $$$a$$$ is lexicographically less than string $$$b$$$, if either $$$a$$$ is a prefix of $$$b$$$ and $$$a \\ne b$$$, or there exists such a position $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le min(|a|, |b|)$$$), such that $$$a_i \\lt b_i$$$ and for all $$$j$$$ ($$$1 \\le j \\lt i$$$) $$$a_j = b_j$$$. Here $$$|a|$$$ denotes the length of the string $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a non-empty string $$$s$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |s| \\leq 10^{5}$$$) consisting of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains an integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of strings to select."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$q$$$ lines contains two integers $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$ ($$$1 \\leq l \\leq r \\leq |s|$$$) and a non-empty string $$$x$$$ consisting of lowercase English letters. The total length of strings $$$x$$$ for all queries does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^{5}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output $$$q$$$ lines, each of them should contain the desired string or $$$-1$$$, if there is no such string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"baa\n5\n1 2 ba\n2 3 a\n1 2 b\n2 3 aa\n1 3 b\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","te